## Spec status tags

Statements tagged [LOCKED] are settled decisions — do not revisit without the
owner explicitly unlocking. [DEFAULT] = current choice, changeable with a
stated reason. [OPEN] = undecided. [VERIFY] = confirm before relying on it.

